Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You all move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.39,0:01:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,With Kaiba still reeling\Nfrom his loss to Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,it's the perfect time to\Nseize control and bring
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,this company's reputation\Nback to what it once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Patience, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.81,0:01:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I defeat little Yugi,\NKaiba's company will become ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.39,0:01:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, had you disposed of\NKaiba as originally promised,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,we would have already assumed power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll finish what you started. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.79,0:01:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is to lay even a\Nfinger upon Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.03,0:01:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he's able to rescue\Nhis younger brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll lose our only tie to the Kaiba name!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.81,0:01:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba's future role\Nas figurehead will not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.03,0:01:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,be jeopardized by his\Nolder brother's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my own plans for Seto Kaiba and\Nthe technical knowledge he possesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.19,0:01:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fail us, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Corp is about to enter\Na new era of prosperity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.77,0:01:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and you are all about to\Nbecome obscenely rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.37,0:01:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,As for you, Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.33,0:02:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,our partnership is just beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.91,0:02:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,can't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.75,0:02:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,all my business
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.66,0:02:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,associates would turn on me\Nafter a single defeat Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,losing to Yugi has shaken\Nmy self-confidence too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good duelist, Kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But not good enough to stop Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.97,0:02:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia, obliterate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.95,0:02:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You play only for power, Kaiba,\Nand that is why you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.09,0:02:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you put your heart in the\Ngame, there's nothing you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Yugi was right, but I can't\Nstart second-guessing myself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.95,0:02:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when Pegasus has kidnapped\Nmy little brother, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.35,0:02:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, if I'm gonna face off against Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to rely on my\Nold dueling instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only chance I\Nhave of freeing Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And once Mokuba is out of harm's way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.59,0:03:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll unleash my wrath on the vultures\Nwho conspired to take over my company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.73,0:03:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If Pegasus thought I would just sit idly\Nby as they dismantled my life's work,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,he was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.77,0:03:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see to it that they all\Nregret ever crossing, said Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, am I seeing things, or is\Nyour Millennium Ring actually glowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not, then we're\Nboth hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's kind of spooky, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The way it's pointing like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like it's being\Ntugged toward the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus' castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would it do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.81,0:03:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it did the\Nsame thing the day I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I had just been transferred\Ninto your school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please welcome\Nyour new classmate, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, try defending this, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.51,0:04:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was watching you guys play Duel\NMonsters when suddenly my ring
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.91,0:04:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,started to glow and pointed right\Ntowards your Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.93,0:04:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Those pointers are somehow able to\Nzone in on other Millennium items.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But then why would it point to the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of what's inside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus's Millennium Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what took my grandpa's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.51,0:04:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My, it's all kind of scary, eh, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.17,0:04:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus grabbing souls with his.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll never forget when mine\Ntook a soul to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.27,0:04:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.89,0:04:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it the more involved I get\Nwith Pegasus in this whole tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.93,0:04:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,the more it all seems to be\Nconnected to these Millennium Items?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.35,0:04:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,First, there was Pegasus's Millennium Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.81,0:04:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Bakura's Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And, of course, my Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I first solved\Nthat ancient puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,playing duel monsters\Nhas never been the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.19,0:05:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, every time I duel, I can feel a\Nstrong, courageous presence within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.01,0:05:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And whatever that spirit is, I pray\Nit will help me save my grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.73,0:05:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.41,0:05:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that, Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.34,0:05:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of us are trying to get some\Nshut-eye here, you insensitive jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.35,0:05:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:06:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,it's kaiba what's he doing here i don't\Nknow but it looks like he means business
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,i haven't seen you since our duel yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.69,0:06:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,oh here your deck i've been keeping it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.99,0:06:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,for you just think of it as a thank you\Nfor that duel you helped me win thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be compensated\Nfor all of your trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.47,0:06:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh actually, Kaiba, I\Nwas thinking that since
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,we're all headed for\Npegasus's castle you could
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,stick with us of course\Nyou'll need some star
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.73,0:06:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,chips don't be so naive\Nthis isn't just a game
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,for me yuki i'm going\Nafter pegasus to save my
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,brother not so i can win\Nsome silly prize have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,fun with your tournament\Nbut kaiba that snobby
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen, tough guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can understand you wanting to get\Nyour little brother back and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.07,0:06:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't go thinking that you're the\Nonly one here with a noble cause, capisce?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.47,0:07:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We all got something worth fighting for,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,so if you want a piece of Pegasus,\Nget in line or deal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.11,0:07:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, hotshot, I ain't\Nscared of you. Nice grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was uncalled for. Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Check his pulse, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.31,0:07:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'm\Ngonna let you in this little
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.41,0:07:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,tournament you're in delay\Nme from finding Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.95,0:07:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you got me to deal with, so bust\Nout your cards and let's get it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if Joey's\Nbeing really brave or nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go look for an\Nopponent you can actually beat,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,like an infant or a monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.73,0:07:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.81,0:07:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That monkey thing gets him every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for\Nyour nonsense, loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.09,0:08:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows you're nothing\Nbut a washed up has-been.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.01,0:08:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, be careful what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba may be a creep,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's still pretty much considered\Nthe top duelist in all the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.49,0:08:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet ever since Yugi\Nmopped the floor with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't even lay a trap\Ncard without flinching.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.09,0:08:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Joey, let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really the wrong\Nguy to pick a fight with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, moneybags?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.37,0:08:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to prove me wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,On one condition. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.31,0:08:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We play using my newest innovation\Nin holographic duel technologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.75,0:08:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It means that if Joey's\Nreally that eager to duel me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,he's going to have to do it using\Nmy latest holographic system.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.11,0:08:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a new high-tech\Ndueling device that allows
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,players the realism of arena\Nmatches in any setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.87,0:08:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like just a regular\Nold briefcase to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.87,0:08:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the briefcase, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Its technology is unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.57,0:09:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a flying saucer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.09,0:09:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.53,0:09:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the most state-of-the-art\Ndisplay modulator ever built.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you think you have what it\Ntakes to handle it, just strap it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.71,0:09:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,First, insert your dueling deck\Ninto the display drive recognizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A life point count will light up and\Nkeep score for you the entire match.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then choose a card to play and\Nset it on the digital card reader.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.89,0:09:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the rest will explain itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.81,0:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.69,0:09:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All set?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.97,0:09:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.53,0:09:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now brace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.93,0:09:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,For my battle-ox.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, check out all those lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like raining glitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's like something\Nfrom an enchanted dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a hologram?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A hologram of unprecedented\Nrealism. It breathes. It snarls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My new dueling disc technology\Neven simulates its odor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing really stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing he won't be\Naround for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All righty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.19,0:10:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Armored Lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Battle Ox!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Axe Slam Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.59,0:10:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.57,0:10:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He withstood your attack! Oh, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.11,0:10:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.01,0:10:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's real enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.33,0:11:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,can't believe it that ugly overgrown\Nox he cut my lizard in half this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,new technology isn't for the fate\Nof heart joey it's intended to force
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,duelists to think on their feet\Nif it's too much for you maybe you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,should give up now bad chance don't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you worry kaiba i'm a quick learner
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Set the card, spin the disc, and bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.15,0:11:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The flame swordsman, ready to\Nslaughter that sirloin of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Flaming sword of battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Joey, the Batlocks is resistant\Nto all fire-type creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I not surprised that you'd\Nmake such an amateur mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.31,0:11:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe from now on you ought to let\NYugi pick all of your moves for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.89,0:11:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Or better yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.85,0:12:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't I teach you some of the\Nadvanced moves of the game the hard way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mystic Horseman and Battle Ox.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Merge into Rabbit Horseman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm afraid\Nof that deformed pony?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.31,0:12:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you something that\Nyou should be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Swamp battle guard, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,X-Raider, avenge my battle guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Go battle steer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.85,0:12:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Garuzis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, uh, let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Smashing Ragnar...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Rude Kaiser!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.39,0:12:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall to the dirt like a whimpering dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:13:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, it took Exodia for\Neven you to beat this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to come up with\Na kick-butt car to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.47,0:13:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.29,0:13:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best at finding\Nways to come back from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right, Joey. Now get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.89,0:13:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No way Kaiba gets away\Nwith calling you a canine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.53,0:13:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.79,0:13:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No one calls me a whimpering dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and once he sees what I got in store for\Nhim, he's gonna be the one in the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's best car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber's in big trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.53,0:13:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Inferno Fire Blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.37,0:13:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.89,0:13:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like a novice to rejoice\Nwhen there's no reason to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.65,0:13:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,True, the round may be yours, but\Nthe duel is about to become mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.33,0:13:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your red eyes is a powerful dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but his ferocity pales in\Ncomparison to my beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.97,0:14:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary Blue Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Eyes White Dragon,\Nwhite lightning attack, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Joey. Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.93,0:14:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay down like the sniveling,\Ndefeated dog I've turned you into.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.57,0:14:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.81,0:14:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say my dual-disc system\Nhas proven quite effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did its stunning realism jar\NJoey into complete and utter submission,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but just look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.65,0:14:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's moping like a frightened dog\Nwith his tail between his legs,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,which is exactly how I\Nintend to leave Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.45,0:15:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.07,0:15:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.35,0:15:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you have to take his\Nconfidence away with his dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey was just starting to\Nbelieve in himself as a duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Beating him doesn't give you\Nthe right to humiliate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.87,0:15:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give that creep the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.07,0:15:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, kid, do you honestly believe\Nthat if you were dueling Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.33,0:15:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,he would have been any more\Nmerciful with you than I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.81,0:15:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that the\Nheart of the cards is a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,powerful philosophy and that\Nit all works well for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.81,0:15:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but I need to duel my own way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.87,0:15:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't risk trying something new,\Nand maybe Joey shouldn't either,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.21,0:15:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,unless he likes life as a dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,scrounging on the scraps of past victories\Nand begging for mercy from true duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.39,0:15:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Kaiba, that's just\Nnot true, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.37,0:15:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.31,0:15:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the attitude you\Nhave to take if you want
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.31,0:15:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,to stand a chance against\NMaximilian Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.81,0:15:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the man who created Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He has every card that's ever\Nbeen made at his disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:15:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's mastered every strategy\Nthat's ever been played.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus always makes sure that he has every\Npossible advantage working in his favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.61,0:16:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm to stand any\Nchance against him at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.85,0:16:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to play by\Nmy own ruthless rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,not his.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.35,0:16:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with your prodigious talents, Yugi,\Nyou'll be defeated like all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.19,0:16:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Because when Pegasus duels, he\Nuses much more than mere skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.49,0:16:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen him use a magic
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that's stronger than any card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.81,0:16:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It was at the Intercontinental\NTournament in New York City.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.63,0:16:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I had been invited as\NPegasus' guest of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A skilled hotshot duelist called Bandit\NKeith had made it to the final match.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.17,0:16:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He was playing well, but I could see that\NPegasus was still just toying with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Keith had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you could see the\Nexpression on your face, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.69,0:16:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what, if you ask\Nnice, I'll finish you fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.77,0:17:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, I want to be a duelist like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This card clinches it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Any final words, cutie pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.05,0:17:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus just stared straight into\NKeith's eyes with unnerving confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he scribbled something on a piece of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,paper and called over\Nsome kid from the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.67,0:17:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Asking for help's illegal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A child could defeat you, Bandit\NKeith, and I'm going to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just started to learn\Nhow to play last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.29,0:17:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow these\Ninstructions and you'll win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.31,0:17:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I do hope you're enjoying\Nthe tournament so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know it must seem so crude to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.15,0:17:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like the holographic dueling stations\Nyour company is developing, eh, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.15,0:18:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If Pegasus thinks he's going to throw\Noff my game with his lame theatrics,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.95,0:18:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,he's dead wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got this match in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Garnicia Elephantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.51,0:18:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Good card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But the note says when you play that,\NI should play this one in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.73,0:18:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.11,0:18:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I think I just took\Nall your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You little snot-nosed brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no way you could have\Nknown I was gonna play that card!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.57,0:18:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.61,0:18:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The card I play, how\Nto beat it, everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.17,0:18:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.37,0:18:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam is the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't know how he did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I only hope my new dual\Ndisk system will give
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.27,0:18:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,me the edge I need to\Nbeat him once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That story, it reminds me\Nof when I faced Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you're about to use\Na Komori Dragon. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.43,0:19:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know every move you'll make\Nbefore you can even make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It was like Pegasus was\Nable to see all my cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.59,0:19:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,that's still no excuse\Nto take it out on us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.19,0:19:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and turn Joey into your\Nnew system's guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.87,0:19:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.78,0:19:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But that system could be my only way\Nto beat Pegasus, so I had to test it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is war for me, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.07,0:19:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend was a casualty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.39,0:19:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, we may not agree\Nwith each other's methods,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but at least we both understand\Nthat Pegasus must be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.35,0:19:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you succeed in\Nrescuing your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.01,0:19:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And I hope you succeed in your ventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope our paths don't\Ncross again before this is all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.11,0:19:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.09,0:19:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you hunting for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.39,0:19:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Or am I hunting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.99,0:20:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
